<td id="A4.T3.2.15.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T3.2.15.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.3pt;">
<span id="A4.T3.2.15.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">I was so happy to sit at the table by the river and eat a crisp apple.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T3.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T3.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T3.2.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:79.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T3.2.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Words-to-Sentence (hard)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T3.2.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T3.2.16.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:178.9pt;">
<span id="A4.T3.2.16.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Construct a single, coherent sentence using the words <span id="A4.T3.2.16.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">algorithm, river, symphony, and moss</span>.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T3.2.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T3.2.16.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.3pt;">
<span id="A4.T3.2.16.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The growth of the moss along the river bank seemed to follow a natural algorithm, a quiet symphony of life unfolding.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T3.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T3.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
